post.description:
Bulk create or update class-subject mappings.
This will replace all existing mappings for the class with the new ones.

Request body example:
{
    "class_id": "uuid",
    "academic_year_id": "uuid",
    "subjects": [
        {
            "subject_id": "uuid",
            "exclude_marks": false,
            "order": 1,
            "is_active": true
        },
        {
            "subject_id": "uuid",
            "exclude_marks": true,
            "order": 2,
            "is_active": true
        }
    ]
}
